<title>UK: Reckitt &amp; Coleman fin director to retire.</title>
<headline>Reckitt &amp; Coleman fin director to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reckitt &amp; Colman Plc said finance director Iain Dobbie would retire in March 1998.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Dobbie had joined the company in 1963 and been finance director since 1986.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
